@host = http://localhost:5028

### Health: liveness
GET {{host}}/health

### Health: readiness (database connectivity)
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### Upload a text document
POST {{host}}/api/documents/text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Q3 Compliance Report",
  "content": "All delivered units passed the voltage compliance test in Q3. The average measured voltage was 229V, within the 220V +/- 10 percent tolerance required by IEC 61010. Two prototypes failed the initial leakage current test and were reworked before delivery.",
  "sourceType": "text"
}

### List documents
GET {{host}}/api/documents

### Get document by id
GET {{host}}/api/documents/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Delete a document
DELETE {{host}}/api/documents/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Create a conversation
POST {{host}}/api/conversations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Voltage compliance questions"
}

### List conversations
GET {{host}}/api/conversations

### Send a message (non-streaming)
POST {{host}}/api/conversations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "What did the Q3 report say about voltage compliance?"
}

### Get message history
GET {{host}}/api/conversations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/messages
